    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just everything. the constant noise, the pressure to perform, the feeling that i'm just dragging this heavy weight around that everyone else seems to be carrying so easily. i feel like i've been running a marathon for years and there's no finish line, just more track. i'm just so done with the struggle. i just want everything to be quiet. permanent quiet.",
